 "AZUL": "BLUE",
 "VERDE": "GREEN",
 "Nuevo modo de armas en el HANGAR": "New weapon mode in the HANGAR",
 "«EL HERALDO HA DESPERTADO.» — ORDO": "\"THE HERALD HAS AWAKENED.\" — ORDO",
 "La colada de metal fundido ha llegado a la cabina.": "The molten metal has reached the cabin.",
 "El oxígeno de la sonda se ha agotado.": "The probe's oxygen has run out.",
 "Los Guardianes del Censo han entrado en la sala de control.": "The Census Guardians have stormed the control room.",
 "MISIÓN ESPECIAL": "SPECIAL MISSION",
 "tras la misión": "after mission",
 "Sin analizar.": "Not analyzed.",
 "Una familia. Un universo que no les deja ir.": "A family. A universe that won't let them go.",
 "NUEVA PARTIDA": "NEW GAME",
 "MISIONES": "MISSIONS",
 "HANGAR": "HANGAR",
 "MODOS EXTRA": "EXTRA MODES",
 "LOGROS": "ACHIEVEMENTS",
 "EXPEDIENTES": "FILES",
 "AJUSTES": "SETTINGS",
 "Oleadas sin fin. ¿Cuánto aguantas?": "Endless waves. How long can you last?",
 "Los 8 jefes seguidos, contra el reloj.": "All 8 bosses back to back, against the clock.",
 "CRÉDITOS": "CREDITS",
 "MODO DE ARMAS": "WEAPON MODE",
 "MEJORAS DEL ESPERANZA": "ESPERANZA UPGRADES",
 "FIN DE LA DEMO": "END OF DEMO",
 "La familia Vega aún no está a salvo": "The Vega family isn't safe yet",
